 'f.t'∆WI Pass 1⊢'Expand' 'collapse' 1
 'f.t'∆WI Pass 0 0⊢'GetInfo' 'expanded'(1 3)
 'f.t'∆WI Pass 1 0⊢'GetInfo' 'expandedonce'(1 3)

